# Docker ve Altyapı Yapılandırması

Usalp'ın yerel geliştirme ve demo ortamı Docker Compose ile yönetilir.
Tüm servisler tek bir `docker compose up` komutuyla ayağa kalkar.

---

## Servis Haritası

| Servis       | Image Base          | Port (dış) | Port (iç) | Açıklama                         |
|--------------|---------------------|------------|-----------|----------------------------------|
| `postgres`   | postgres:16-alpine  | —          | 5432      | Dışarıya kapalı                  |
| `backend`    | python:3.12-slim    | —          | 8000      | FastAPI                          |
| `dashboard`  | node:20-alpine      | —          | 3000      | Next.js                          |
| `nginx`      | nginx:1.25-alpine   | 80, 443    | 80, 443   | Reverse proxy + TLS termination  |

---

## `docker-compose.yml`

```yaml
services:
  postgres:
    image: postgres:16-alpine
    restart: unless-stopped
    environment:
      POSTGRES_DB: usalp
      POSTGRES_USER: usalp
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}
    volumes:
      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data
    healthcheck:
      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "pg_isready -U usalp"]
      interval: 10s
      timeout: 5s
      retries: 5
    networks:
      - internal

  backend:
    build:
      context: ./backend
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    restart: unless-stopped
    environment:
      DATABASE_URL: postgresql+asyncpg://usalp:${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}@postgres:5432/usalp
      LLM_API_KEY: ${LLM_API_KEY}
      AGENT_API_KEY: ${AGENT_API_KEY}
      SECRET_KEY: ${SECRET_KEY}
      ENVIRONMENT: ${ENVIRONMENT:-development}
    depends_on:
      postgres:
        condition: service_healthy
    networks:
      - internal
    volumes:
      - ./backend:/app   # Development: hot reload

  dashboard:
    build:
      context: ./dashboard
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    restart: unless-stopped
    environment:
      NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: /api/v1   # Nginx üzerinden proxy
    depends_on:
      - backend
    networks:
      - internal

  nginx:
    image: nginx:1.25-alpine
    restart: unless-stopped
    ports:
      - "80:80"
      - "443:443"
    volumes:
      - ./nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro
      - ./nginx/certs:/etc/nginx/certs:ro   # TLS sertifikaları
    depends_on:
      - backend
      - dashboard
    networks:
      - internal
      - external

volumes:
  postgres_data:

networks:
  internal:
    driver: bridge
  external:
    driver: bridge
```

