## `.env.example`

```env
# PostgreSQL
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change_me_strong_password

# Anthropic Claude
LLM_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Agent kimlik doğrulama (backend ile agent aynı değeri kullanır)
AGENT_API_KEY=usalp-agent-change-me

# JWT imzalama (openssl rand -hex 32)
SECRET_KEY=change_me_32_byte_hex

# Ortam
ENVIRONMENT=development

# Dashboard (Next.js)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost/api/v1
```

